<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Aug 5.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Aug 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 per cent protein to London Aug 122.00 Apr/Jun 115.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to East Anglia this week 84.00 asa 81.00 Oct/Dec 87.50 Apr/Jun 93.50/93.25</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Oct/Dec 88.00 Apr/Jun 93.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire this week 85.00</p>
<p>Liverpool this week 88.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire this week 87.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 87.00 Jan/Mar 90.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to East Anglia asa 73.50/74.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire asa 75.50</p>
</text>
